WEBVTT

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:34.160
When I was 17 years old,

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:40.720
I was a college student
at Tuskegee University,

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:47.416
and I was a worker
in the Southern freedom movement,

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:50.080
which we call the Civil Rights Movement.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.360
During this time,

00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:01.976
I met another young 26-year-old,